  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights Promotions and Protection Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights at the United Nations to mobilize a Senior Human Rights Advisor to be embedded within the the UN Resident Coordinator&apos;s Office in Malawi. The Senior Human Rights Advisor will support the Malawi Government, Civil Society Organizations, the Academia and other stakeholder to promote and protect human rights in Malawi. Among other activities, the Senior Human Rights Advisor will build capacity of state and non-state actors to effectively plan and deliver human rights activities.</narrative>
  </description>
